        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Kelley Yost Abrams",
        "text_sha256": "1ed3a597bbb483834de30de377d45bdabd49633e86269d901a85dc9da1316522",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Kelley Yost Abrams, Ph.D.",
        "text_sha256": "0844911c1653835c0291d8dbffce904eee8ac3ecf63b601faa488672cee96862",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Kelley Yost Abrams, Ph.D.",
        "text_sha256": "3f07bb8ba76373ae1f200137f8334dfb753cc02e29c6073115fda3c12a89087d",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Kelley Yost Abrams is a family and childhood therapist, an early childhood researcher, and a consultant specializing in parent-child relationships, social-emotional development, and infant mental health.",
        "text_sha256": "0c34d7414322d5f1cd7312f4976bc8d37fe74930936b4b90db2f7f81001b06eb",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Yost Abrams received her Ph.D. in developmental psychology at the University of California, Berkeley.",
        "text_sha256": "69c96b3ec8f861ffe645d23798f8fb0800a5e39e3e962b3bd236de1b010114d6",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Experience",
        "text_sha256": "8eab0f09df013b1bd69655991bb824cfa822d383b482905789153d4df8bfda78",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Yost Abrams leads operations at Jigsaw Diagnostics, a telehealth provider of early autism and other neurobehavioral evaluations. She provides expertise to leading pediatric organizations and has been at the forefront of digital therapeutics.",
        "text_sha256": "de8a1b48139f4efd369dd25fab1afdec0122c80d7348b3eacc3db93b0f6169bb",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Yost Abrams founded a company called Child Development and Parenting Consultations, and offers therapy services to parents at Maven Clinic, which provides online therapy services and is based in New York City.",
        "text_sha256": "201288e7466d68d5e27c978a30cae31026024b3d29b1bfe94e5544c4eba8bc14",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "She has served families with a diverse range of needs, including those with premature infants and parents of children with behavioral difficulties, developmental delays, disabilities, giftedness, autism spectrum disorder, anxiety and ADHD.",
        "text_sha256": "8f0178d32317a239dcfbaeba7239068ab4c4c9d75a066d54f88b04fe2b566cd2",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Yost Abrams is a fellow with Zero to Three, a parenting website, and a member of the advisory board of Greenlightfund.org. She is also the mother of two teens.",
        "text_sha256": "e4d15c5c3079d2b41b2a66a785382d8db32a44f8c726530033928d22cea1fc73",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
